{"schema_version": 2, "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "effort": "medium", "params": {"n": 3, "occurrences": 3}, "seed": 1566796349, "solved": "solved", "parsed": true, "verify_ok": true, "verify_reason": "ok", "reply": "Looking at this problem, I need to find 12 elements to delete such that the remaining 51 elements form a sum-free set.\n\n**Approach:** I'll try keeping the \"large\" elements (deleting mostly small ones), since sums of two large numbers tend to exceed the maximum element, avoiding x+y=z issues.\n\n**Step 1:** Sort A and consider deleting the 12 smallest elements. This leaves a set B with minimum element 30577 and maximum 66572.\n\n**Step 2:** Since max(B)=66572, any sum x+y=z requires x+y \u2264 66572, meaning both x,y must be relatively small (\u226433286ish). I check all pairs among the small elements {30577, 31251, 31927, 32605, 33285, 33967} against the full set B, and find conflicts:\n- 30577+31251=61828 (in B)\n- 31251+31927=63178 (in B)\n- 31251+33285=64536 (in B)\n- 32605+33285=65890 (in B)\n- 32605+33967=66572 (in B)\n\n**Step 3:** Removing 31251 and 32605 breaks all 5 conflicting equations (a minimal hitting set).\n\n**Step 4:** To keep total deletions at 12, I swap two of the originally-deleted smallest elements back into B, replacing them with 31251 and 32605 in the deletion set. Testing candidates for zero new conflicts (checking sums with remaining small elements 30577, 31927, 33285, 33967), I find **23295** and **25915** cause no conflicts when restored to B.\n\n**Final deletion set D':**\n{22645, 23947, 24601, 25257, 26575, 27237, 27901, 28567, 29235, 29905, 31251, 32605}\n\n**Verification:** The resulting B' = A \\ D' has 51 elements with minimum 23295. Checking all pairs (x,y) with x \u2264 y \u2264 33286 (so that x+y \u2264 66572 is possible) against all elements of B' confirms no sum x+y equals any z in B'. Thus B' is sum-free.\n\n<answer>22645, 23947, 24601, 25257, 26575, 27237, 27901, 28567, 29235, 29905, 31251, 32605</answer>", "error": null, "elapsed_sec": 153.41, "http_status": 200, "finish_reason": "stop", "preset": "demo", "escalation_round": 0}
